          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Brana font is the Unicode porting of the Brana I and Brana II fonts that were distributed with the Brana 90 software application. The font is compliant with the Basic Ethiopic range defined by the Unicode standard and includes a few additions from the Ethiopic extensions introduced in the Unicode 4.1 standard.\n\nSource Repository:\n\nhttps://github.com/raeytype/brana-regular/"
